Let me also double-check `downloadBestUrl`: It catches `InvalidArgumentException | RuntimeException` and, unless it's a cancellation, moves to the next candidate. With low-speed timeout, a stalled attempt throws RuntimeException(CURLE_OPERATION_TIMEDOUT) → caught → `isCancelled()`? If not cancelled, retries next candidate. Fine. If cancelled → InstallationCancelledException. Good.

