                    'modpackinstaller manifest download failed for '
                    . $failedMods
                    . ' of '
                    . $wantedMods
                    . ' mod files; continuing with the rest.'
                );
            }

            $writer->finish();
        } finally {
            fclose($output);

            foreach ($downloadedTemps as $downloadPath) {
                @unlink($downloadPath);
            }
        }

        return $outputPath;
    }

